    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds solid. for the color coding, what specific colors do you recommend? i want to make sure it's intuitive for the servers moving through a busy room, but also looks professional enough for a law firm setting. i don't want it to look like a kids party or anything.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
