      "content": "the color scheme sounds fine, thanks. one more thing—how do you feel about the actual wording on the cards? i dont want to be too blunt or cause alarm, but i need to be extremely clear about the risk. like, is there a way to phrase it that is serious but still fits the upscale vibe of a gala?",
